span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>类型检查器自上而下地匹配 AST 节点与这些规则：遇到一个 <code>+</code> 节点，套用加法规则，递归检查两个子表达式都是 <code>int</code>，成立则给整个节点标注 <code>int</code>，否则报错。这套「按语法结构递归套规则」的过程，与 <a href=\"../foundations/semantic-analysis-overview\">语义分析阶段总览</a> 里属性文法的综合属性是同一回事的两种说法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则的机械执行\">规则的机械执行</h3><p>把上面两条规则直接译成代码，就是类型检查器的骨架——每个 <code>case</code> 对应一条推理规则，递归调用对应规则的前提。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"infer(Γ, e):&#10;  match e:&#10;    Var(x):        return Γ[x]                         # 变量规则：查上下文&#10;    Lit(n):        return Int                          # 字面量规则&#10;    Add(e1, e2):                                       # 加法规则&#10;      t1 = infer(Γ, e1); t2 = infer(Γ, e2)&#10;      if t1 == Int and t2 == Int: return Int&#10;      else: error(&quot;+ 需要两个 int&quot;)&#10;    App(e1, e2):                                       # 应用规则&#10;      t1 = infer(Γ, e1); t2 = infer(Γ, e2)&#10;      if t1 is Fn(tparam, tres) and t2 == tparam: return tres&#10;      else: error(&quot;函数应用类型不符&quot;)&#10;    Let(x, e1, e2):                                    # let 规则：扩展上下文&#10;      t1 = infer(Γ, e1)&#10;      return infer(Γ ∪ {x: t1}, e2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>infer(Γ, e):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Var(x):        return Γ[x]                         # 变量规则：查上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Lit(n):        return Int                          # 字面量规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Add(e1, e2):                                       # 加法规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      t1 = infer(Γ, e1); t2 = infer(Γ, e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if t1 == Int and t2 == Int: return Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else: error(\"+ 需要两个 int\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    App(e1, e2):                                       # 应用规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      t1 = infer(Γ, e1); t2 = infer(Γ, e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if t1 is Fn(tparam, tres) and t2 == tparam: return tres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else: error(\"函数应用类型不符\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Let(x, e1, e2):                                    # let 规则：扩展上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      t1 = infer(Γ, e1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return infer(Γ ∪ {x: t1}, e2)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段伪代码里没有任何「额外智慧」：它不加判断、不做猜测，只是逐条套用规则。规则若写错，检查器就错——这正是「类型检查器是规则的一次机械执行」的字面含义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;判断 Γ ⊢ e : τ&quot;] --&gt; B{e 的语法形态}&#10;  B --&gt;|变量 x| C[&quot;查 Γ 取 x 的类型&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|字面量| D[&quot;按字面量给定基础类型&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|e1 + e2| E[&quot;递归: 两子式须为 int&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|函数应用 e1 e2| F[&quot;e1 须为 τ1→τ2&lt;br/&gt;e2 须为 τ1&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|let x=e1 in e2| G[&quot;先定 x 类型&lt;br/&gt;扩展 Γ 再查 e2&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; H[标注类型/通过]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"判断 Γ ⊢ e : τ\"] --&gt; B{e 的语法形态}\n  B --&gt;|变量 x| C[\"查 Γ 取 x 的类型\"]\n  B --&gt;|字面量| D[\"按字面量给定基础类型\"]\n  B --&gt;|e1 + e2| E[\"递归: 两子式须为 int\"]\n  B --&gt;|函数应用 e1 e2| F[\"e1 须为 τ1→τ2&lt;br/&gt;e2 须为 τ1\"]\n  B --&gt;|let x=e1 in e2| G[\"先定 x 类型&lt;br/&gt;扩展 Γ 再查 e2\"]\n  C --&gt; H[标注类型/通过]\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"上下文如何增长-绑定构造\">上下文如何增长：绑定构造</h2><p>变量规则只是「读」上下文，真正让上下文变化的是引入绑定的构造，比如 <code>let</code> 与函数抽象（lambda）。<code>let</code> 的规则展示了上下文如何被扩展：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊢</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mtext>let </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> in </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Gamma \\vdash e_1 : \\tau_1 \\quad \\Gamma, x:\\tau_1 \\vdash e_2 : \\tau_2}{\\Gamma \\vdash \\text{let } x = e_1 \\text{ in } e_2 : \\tau_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">let </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> in </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"mar