sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意检查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时用的是扩展后的上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma, x:\\tau_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这正对应 <a href=\"../foundations/symbol-tables-scoping\">符号表与作用域解析</a> 里「进入作用域时把新绑定加进符号表」。函数抽象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda x.e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 的规则同理，把参数绑定加入上下文再检查函数体。形式系统里上下文的「扩展」与编译器里符号表的「压栈」是一一对应的——前者是理论模型，后者是它的可执行实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全-进展与保持\">类型安全：进展与保持</h2><p>为什么要费力把类型检查写成形式规则？因为这样才能证明「类型检查通过的程序不会出某类运行时错误」。这条性质叫类型安全（type soundness），经典证明拆成两条引理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>进展（Progress）</strong>：一个良类型的封闭表达式，要么已是值，要么还能继续求值一步——即它不会「卡住」（stuck），比如不会出现「把整数当函数调用」这种无规则可走的状态。</li>\n<li><strong>保持（Preservation，又称 subject reduction）</strong>：良类型的表达式求值一步后，类型不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二者合起来给出著名的口号「Well-typed programs cannot go wrong」（良类型的程序不会出错）。下表对照三类与类型系统密切相关的性质。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁来保证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可靠性 soundness</td>\n<td>类型检查通过 ⇒ 无该类运行时类型错误</td>\n<td>类型系统设计 + 进展/保持证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完备性 completeness</td>\n<td>无该类错误的程序 ⇒ 类型检查必通过</td>\n<td>通常做不到（会拒绝部分正确程序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可判定性 decidability</td>\n<td>类型检查算法必然终止并给出答案</td>\n<td>规则需精心设计以避免不可判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"两条引理如何合围\">两条引理如何合围</h3><p>进展与保持的分工可以用一次求值步串起来：程序每走一步，类型都原样保留，于是坏状态永远无法出现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"设 e 良类型，Γ ⊢ e : τ。对求值步数归纳：&#10;  步 0:  e 是良类型                        （前提）&#10;  步 k:  e_k : τ  且  e_k 未卡住            （保持给出前者，进展给出后者）&#10;  步 k+1: e_k → e_{k+1}，由保持 e_{k+1} : τ （类型不变）&#10;  ...&#10;  终止:  e →* v  且  v : τ                 （不会卡住，值符合原类型）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>设 e 良类型，Γ ⊢ e : τ。对求值步数归纳：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  步 0:  e 是良类型                        （前提）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  步 k:  e_k : τ  且  e_k 未卡住            （保持给出前者，进展给出后者）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  步 k+1: e_k → e_{k+1}，由保持 e_{k+1} : τ （类型不变）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  终止:  e →* v  且  v : τ                 （不会卡住，值符合原类型）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>进展排除了「卡住」，保持排除了「类型漂移」；缺任何一条，口号都不成立。</p>\n<p>现实中可靠性优先、完备性主动放弃：类型检查器宁可拒绝某些其实安全的程序，也不能放过任何不安全的程序——这种「保守」是静态类型的代价，也是它能给出保证的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声明式规则与算法式规则\">声明式规则与算法式规则</h2><p>上面那些规则是「声明式」（declarative）的：它们规定「什么样的判断成立」，却没说「如何一步步把类型算出来」。比如函数应用规则假设你已经知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的类型是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1 \\to \\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但没说这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从哪来。把声明式规则改造成可直接执行的「算法式」（algorithmic）规则，是实现类型检查器的关键一步——要么要求程序员补足注解，要么引入类型变量延后求解。前者通向 <a href=\"subtyping-coercion\">子类型与隐式转换</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/gradual-bidirectional\">渐进与双向类型检查</a> 处理的注解策略，后者通向下一篇 <a href=\"type-inference\">类型推断</a> 的合一机制。声明式规则定义「正确」，算法式规则定义「如何高效判定正确」，二者的等价性本身就是一条需要证明的定理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型判断 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma \\vdash e : \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心记号，上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 来自名称解析的绑定；推理规则用「前提横线结论」刻画判断何时成立。</li>\n<li>类型检查器按 AST 结构递归套规则，本质上是属性文法里综合属性的形式化版本。</li>\n<li><code>let</code> 与 lambda 等绑定构造扩展上下文，对应符号表进入作用域时的压栈。</li>\n<li>类型安全由进展（不卡住）与保持（求值不改类型）两条引理共同保证；实践中追求可靠性、主动放弃完备性，故会保守地拒绝部分安全程序。</li>\n<li>声明式规则定义「何为正确」，算法式规则定义「如何判定」，前者引向注解与子类型，后者引向类型推断的合一机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型规则与判断","id":"类型规则与判断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"规则的机械执行","id":"规则的机械执行"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文如何增长：绑定构造","id":"上下文如何增长-绑定构造"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全：进展与保持","id":"类型安全-进展与保持"},{"level":3,"text":"两条引理如何合围","id":"两条引理如何合围"},{"level":2,"text":"声明式规则与算法式规则","id":"声明式规则与算法式规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"名称解析与绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/foundations/name-resolution"},"next":{"title":"类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-inference"}}